  "duration_s": 542.673991,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "我跟你说件事儿，洛阳这座城市可能是全中国最委屈的古都，没有之一。为什么这么说？你听听大家对他的评价就知道了。洛阳啊牡丹挺好看，洛阳啊龙门石窟拍张照挺出片儿。洛阳啊水席挺好吃的，然后呢没有然后了。在很多人的认知里，这座十三朝古都已经退休了，坐在历史的功劳簿上，靠，每年四月的牡丹花会续命。我两年前去的时候，就是这个心态，白马寺转一圈，龙门石窟打个卡，看一场牡丹走的时候，心里还给他下了个结论，古都就剩个名头了，夜市还没旁边，郑州热闹也就那么回事儿。直到去年春天，一个德国人把我点醒了。不是真点，是那种让你整个人愣在原地的。追问，他是一位研究啊，欧亚古都兴衰的历史学者干了三十多年，德国人嘛较真一辈子就琢磨一件事，历史上的大城市为什么兴起？为什么衰落？为什么有的摔了就再也起不来？这趟来中国是受邀考察古都保护行程单上，北京、西安都有，但他自己加了一战，洛阳说什么都要来现场走一走。到了洛阳，我没带他去牡丹园，直接去了。应天门遗址，他站在那片隋唐宫城的夯土钳又踱到漯河边，看着那条并不宽的河，一句话不说，看了半个多小时，然后他突然转过头问我，你知道你脚下这条河的两边埋着几座都城吗？我说，知道洛阳吗？十三朝古都，他说十三朝，你知道这十三座城都埋在什么地方吗？我摇头，他蹲下来，在地图上从东往西画了一条线三十公里，从二里头下的都城到偃池商城，五汤灭夏之后建的城，再到东周王城，再到汉卫洛阳城，再到隋唐洛阳城五座都城遗址，沿着这条漯河一字排开，东西直线距离，只有三十多公里。学考古的管这个叫五都会，洛五座都城全部入选了中国百年百大考古发现。他站起身说，我在欧洲研究了三十年古城巴比伦现在是一片土丘，比比斯现在是个村子。罗马被攻陷之后，再也没能回到帝国首都的位置上。一座都城衰落之后，还能在原址重新爬起来的，全世界的被我找不出。第二个，而你们这座城灭了，再见。见了再面灭了，接着见十三个王朝一千五百多年都城市别的国家是保住了一座遗址。你们是在一个盆地里罗了一罗都城，全世界的古都都死在原址上，只有洛阳在原址上反复复活。第二天，他非要去看二里头。在夏都遗址博物馆，他站在那件汝丁文铜爵前面，突然又问我，你知道中国人为什么三千年前非要往这片盆地里建都吗？我说位置好啊，中原富庶，天下粮仓。他摇头说，你们总是用经济解释一切。他说，欧洲人选都城的逻辑是港口，是贸易，是军事。雅典对着海罗马，卡着河道伦敦守着入海口，但你们的祖宗不是你们的祖宗发明了另一个逻辑。叫泽中三千年前，周公在这里用龟表测日影，测出这里是天下的正中间，四方诸侯来进贡路程，远近差不多均等。所以把新都建在这里，他指着掌柜里何尊铭文的他骗说，你知道中国这两个字最早出现在哪吗？就这尊青铜器上一百二十二字的铭文宅资中国，我要住在天下的中央。中国这个词诞生的时候，指的不是整个国家，就是脚下这片盆地，就是洛阳。然后他说了一段让我头皮发麻的话，我们欧洲人打了两千年仗，画了无数张地图，到今天都没想明白一件事。一个文明的心脏可以不靠海，不靠边，不卡任何伤路。就因为他在中间你们的祖宗，用一个中字，给一个文明定了三千年的位。今天你们的国家还叫中国，而你们脚下这块地是这个名字最初落地的地方，全世界的都城都是经济和军事的产物。只有这个文明给都城发明了一个理由，叫居中。第三天，我们去了汉卫洛阳城遗址那座城，当年一百平方公里，是当时全世界最大的都市。北魏孝文帝把一个游牧王朝的都城迁到这里，下诏全国改汉姓，说汉话，穿汉服从皇帝，开始把自己改成中原人。后来这座城毁于战乱，今天只剩下一望无际的夯土，他在那片废墟上占了很久。突然问我，你们你知道司马光路过这里的时候写了一句什么吗？我说不知道，他说若问古今兴废事，请君只看洛阳城。然后他说，你知道这句话狠在哪吗？司马光的意思是，想知道一个文明会不会断，不用读史书来洛阳看就行。这座城被烧过，被淹过，被抢过，被废弃过，塌了那么多次，可隋朝建新都还是回到这个盆地，为什么？因为在中国的观念里，这不是一块地产，这是一个坐标城塌了可以重修，坐标不能挪，这不是一座城市的任性，这是一个文明对自己来处的执念。我站在汉卫故城的夯土上，突然意识到，洛阳真正的分量根本不在牡丹里，也不在石窟里。而在这片盆地，一次次从废墟里原地长出新都城的执念里，别的城市怕衰落。洛阳的地基里，罗着一落盛世，回来之后，我怎么也放不下。搜了一圈，发现讲洛阳的文章，要么讲牡丹，要么讲汉服打卡，要么教你怎么点水席，几乎没有人讲武都贿赂这个人类文明史上的孤立。更没人讲，中国这两个字，最初就是为这片盆地写下的。后来翻到那套书中国历史名城，中央民族大学出版社符号中国系列搬到洛阳那一部分一口气读完。他不是把洛阳当一个旅游城市来写，他掰开了桨，为什么夏商周非要挤在这条河的两边？为什么周公要在这里立表恻隐？为什么？十三朝塌了又见见了，又他为什么中国之民从这片盆地走向九州，每一座老城翻开都是一句话，原来我们的祖宗敢想敢干到这个地步。下次你要是去洛阳，别光蹲在牡丹丛里拍照，去漯河边上站一站，往东西两头望一望三十公里，五个王朝在土里排着队等你。这座立了几千年的古都，等的不是游客一聚，也就那样。等的是，终于有个中国人站在漯河边上，说，我知道你是什么你是我们的祖宗。三千年前跟这片土地达成的约定，成可以塌文明的正脉不挪地方，至今没有失约，书放在橱窗了。点左下角头像主页、橱窗就能看到一张应天门门票的钱，把十三朝的历史原原本本带回家。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 1770,
      "text": "我跟你说件事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1770,
      "end_ms": 5490,
      "text": "洛阳这座城市可能是全中国最委屈的古都，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5670,
      "end_ms": 6450,
      "text": "没有之一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00004",
      "start_ms": 7250,
      "end_ms": 8130,
      "text": "为什么这么说？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00005",
      "start_ms": 9130,
      "end_ms": 11290,
      "text": "你听听大家对他的评价就知道了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00006",
      "start_ms": 11570,
      "end_ms": 13390,
      "text": "洛阳啊牡丹挺好看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00007",
      "start_ms": 14110,
      "end_ms": 17510,
      "text": "洛阳啊龙门石窟拍张照挺出片儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00008",
      "start_ms": 17890,
      "end_ms": 20030,
      "text": "洛阳啊水席挺好吃的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00009",
      "start_ms": 20370,
      "end_ms": 22170,
      "text": "然后呢没有然后了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00010",
      "start_ms": 22530,
      "end_ms": 24330,
      "text": "在很多人的认知里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00011",
      "start_ms": 24830,
      "end_ms": 27270,
      "text": "这座十三朝古都已经退休了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00012",
      "start_ms": 27990,
      "end_ms": 29785,
      "text": "坐在历史的功劳簿上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00013",
      "start_ms": 30140,
      "end_ms": 30380,
      "text": "靠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00014",
      "start_ms": 30400,
      "end_ms": 33100,
      "text": "每年四月的牡丹花会续命。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00015",
      "start_ms": 33240,
      "end_ms": 35000,
      "text": "我两年前去的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00016",
      "start_ms": 35240,
      "end_ms": 36320,
      "text": "就是这个心态，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00017",
      "start_ms": 36860,
      "end_ms": 38180,
      "text": "白马寺转一圈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00018",
      "start_ms": 38520,
      "end_ms": 39960,
      "text": "龙门石窟打个卡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00019",
      "start_ms": 40280,
      "end_ms": 42500,
      "text": "看一场牡丹走的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00020",
      "start_ms": 42500,
      "end_ms": 43740,
      "text": "心里还给他下了个结论，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00021",
      "start_ms": 43740,
      "end_ms": 45640,
      "text": "古都就剩个名头了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00022",
      "start_ms": 45640,
      "end_ms": 47260,
      "text": "夜市还没旁边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00023",
      "start_ms": 47260,
      "end_ms": 49580,
      "text": "郑州热闹也就那么回事儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00024",
      "start_ms": 50020,
      "end_ms": 51220,
      "text": "直到去年春天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00025",
      "start_ms": 51720,
      "end_ms": 53380,
      "text": "一个德国人把我点醒了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00026",
      "start_ms": 53440,
      "end_ms": 54280,
      "text": "不是真点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00027",
      "start_ms": 54280,
      "end_ms": 57500,
      "text": "是那种让你整个人愣在原地的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00028",
      "start_ms": 57500,
      "end_ms": 57860,
      "text": "追问，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00029",
      "start_ms": 57860,
      "end_ms": 59900,
      "text": "他是一位研究啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00030",
      "start_ms": 60070,
      "end_ms": 64495,
      "text": "欧亚古都兴衰的历史学者干了三十多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00031",
      "start_ms": 65590,
      "end_ms": 69045,
      "text": "德国人嘛较真一辈子就琢磨一件事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00032",
      "start_ms": 69500,
      "end_ms": 72345,
      "text": "历史上的大城市为什么兴起？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00033",
      "start_ms": 72720,
      "end_ms": 73725,
      "text": "为什么衰落？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00034",
      "start_ms": 74090,
      "end_ms": 76435,
      "text": "为什么有的摔了就再也起不来？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00035",
      "start_ms": 77010,
      "end_ms": 81230,
      "text": "这趟来中国是受邀考察古都保护行程单上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00036",
      "start_ms": 81250,
      "end_ms": 82565,
      "text": "北京、西安都有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00037",
      "start_ms": 82950,
      "end_ms": 84450,
      "text": "但他自己加了一战，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00038",
      "start_ms": 84470,
      "end_ms": 87255,
      "text": "洛阳说什么都要来现场走一走。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00039",
      "start_ms": 88060,
      "end_ms": 88815,
      "text": "到了洛阳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00040",
      "start_ms": 89190,
      "end_ms": 90585,
      "text": "我没带他去牡丹园，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00041",
      "start_ms": 90990,
      "end_ms": 91710,
      "text": "直接去了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00042",
      "start_ms": 91710,
      "end_ms": 92685,
      "text": "应天门遗址，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00043",
      "start_ms": 93220,
      "end_ms": 99325,
      "text": "他站在那片隋唐宫城的夯土钳又踱到漯河边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00044",
      "start_ms": 99680,
      "end_ms": 101700,
      "text": "看着那条并不宽的河，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00045",
      "start_ms": 101900,
      "end_ms": 102820,
      "text": "一句话不说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00046",
      "start_ms": 103080,
      "end_ms": 104355,
      "text": "看了半个多小时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00047",
      "start_ms": 104810,
      "end_ms": 106495,
      "text": "然后他突然转过头问我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00048",
      "start_ms": 106830,
      "end_ms": 110865,
      "text": "你知道你脚下这条河的两边埋着几座都城吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00049",
      "start_ms": 111200,
      "end_ms": 111480,
      "text": "我说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00050",
      "start_ms": 111480,
      "end_ms": 112795,
      "text": "知道洛阳吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00051",
      "start_ms": 113310,
      "end_ms": 114375,
      "text": "十三朝古都，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00052",
      "start_ms": 114860,
      "end_ms": 115925,
      "text": "他说十三朝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00053",
      "start_ms": 116370,
      "end_ms": 119755,
      "text": "你知道这十三座城都埋在什么地方吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00054",
      "start_ms": 120240,
      "end_ms": 120840,
      "text": "我摇头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00055",
      "start_ms": 121320,
      "end_ms": 122140,
      "text": "他蹲下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00056",
      "start_ms": 122420,
      "end_ms": 128020,
      "text": "在地图上从东往西画了一条线三十公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00057",
      "start_ms": 128380,
      "end_ms": 132800,
      "text": "从二里头下的都城到偃池商城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00058",
      "start_ms": 133140,
      "end_ms": 135200,
      "text": "五汤灭夏之后建的城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00059",
      "start_ms": 135740,
      "end_ms": 137160,
      "text": "再到东周王城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00060",
      "start_ms": 137360,
      "end_ms": 138780,
      "text": "再到汉卫洛阳城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00061",
      "start_ms": 139240,
      "end_ms": 142800,
      "text": "再到隋唐洛阳城五座都城遗址，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00062",
      "start_ms": 143040,
      "end_ms": 146080,
      "text": "沿着这条漯河一字排开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00063",
      "start_ms": 146540,
      "end_ms": 148020,
      "text": "东西直线距离，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00064",
      "start_ms": 148020,
      "end_ms": 149645,
      "text": "只有三十多公里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00065",
      "start_ms": 150150,
      "end_ms": 152030,
      "text": "学考古的管这个叫五都会，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00066",
      "start_ms": 152030,
      "end_ms": 158010,
      "text": "洛五座都城全部入选了中国百年百大考古发现。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00067",
      "start_ms": 158510,
      "end_ms": 159510,
      "text": "他站起身说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00068",
      "start_ms": 159950,
      "end_ms": 166329,
      "text": "我在欧洲研究了三十年古城巴比伦现在是一片土丘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00069",
      "start_ms": 166850,
      "end_ms": 169270,
      "text": "比比斯现在是个村子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00070",
      "start_ms": 169730,
      "end_ms": 171310,
      "text": "罗马被攻陷之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00071",
      "start_ms": 171730,
      "end_ms": 174470,
      "text": "再也没能回到帝国首都的位置上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00072",
      "start_ms": 174630,
      "end_ms": 176450,
      "text": "一座都城衰落之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00073",
      "start_ms": 176470,
      "end_ms": 178850,
      "text": "还能在原址重新爬起来的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00074",
      "start_ms": 178850,
      "end_ms": 180760,
      "text": "全世界的被我找不出。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00075",
      "start_ms": 180760,
      "end_ms": 181225,
      "text": "第二个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00076",
      "start_ms": 181860,
      "end_ms": 184060,
      "text": "而你们这座城灭了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00077",
      "start_ms": 184060,
      "end_ms": 184535,
      "text": "再见。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00078",
      "start_ms": 184970,
      "end_ms": 186690,
      "text": "见了再面灭了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00079",
      "start_ms": 186690,
      "end_ms": 194325,
      "text": "接着见十三个王朝一千五百多年都城市别的国家是保住了一座遗址。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00080",
      "start_ms": 194800,
      "end_ms": 197725,
      "text": "你们是在一个盆地里罗了一罗都城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00081",
      "start_ms": 198160,
      "end_ms": 200765,
      "text": "全世界的古都都死在原址上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00082",
      "start_ms": 201190,
      "end_ms": 203655,
      "text": "只有洛阳在原址上反复复活。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00083",
      "start_ms": 204130,
      "end_ms": 204675,
      "text": "第二天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00084",
      "start_ms": 205050,
      "end_ms": 207075,
      "text": "他非要去看二里头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00085",
      "start_ms": 207400,
      "end_ms": 208800,
      "text": "在夏都遗址博物馆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00086",
      "start_ms": 208820,
      "end_ms": 211545,
      "text": "他站在那件汝丁文铜爵前面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00087",
      "start_ms": 212340,
      "end_ms": 213165,
      "text": "突然又问我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00088",
      "start_ms": 213540,
      "end_ms": 218495,
      "text": "你知道中国人为什么三千年前非要往这片盆地里建都吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00089",
      "start_ms": 219340,
      "end_ms": 220425,
      "text": "我说位置好啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00090",
      "start_ms": 221740,
      "end_ms": 223015,
      "text": "中原富庶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00091",
      "start_ms": 223510,
      "end_ms": 224455,
      "text": "天下粮仓。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00092",
      "start_ms": 224720,
      "end_ms": 226430,
      "text": "他摇头说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00093",
      "start_ms": 226430,
      "end_ms": 228945,
      "text": "你们总是用经济解释一切。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00094",
      "start_ms": 229710,
      "end_ms": 230050,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00095",
      "start_ms": 230050,
      "end_ms": 232950,
      "text": "欧洲人选都城的逻辑是港口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00096",
      "start_ms": 233130,
      "end_ms": 233895,
      "text": "是贸易，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00097",
      "start_ms": 234220,
      "end_ms": 234965,
      "text": "是军事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00098",
      "start_ms": 236270,
      "end_ms": 238030,
      "text": "雅典对着海罗马，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00099",
      "start_ms": 238030,
      "end_ms": 240665,
      "text": "卡着河道伦敦守着入海口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00100",
      "start_ms": 240950,
      "end_ms": 245635,
      "text": "但你们的祖宗不是你们的祖宗发明了另一个逻辑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00101",
      "start_ms": 245880,
      "end_ms": 247940,
      "text": "叫泽中三千年前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00102",
      "start_ms": 248220,
      "end_ms": 250775,
      "text": "周公在这里用龟表测日影，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00103",
      "start_ms": 251220,
      "end_ms": 253485,
      "text": "测出这里是天下的正中间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00104",
      "start_ms": 254140,
      "end_ms": 256550,
      "text": "四方诸侯来进贡路程，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00105",
      "start_ms": 256550,
      "end_ms": 257925,
      "text": "远近差不多均等。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00106",
      "start_ms": 258300,
      "end_ms": 259965,
      "text": "所以把新都建在这里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00107",
      "start_ms": 260620,
      "end_ms": 264605,
      "text": "他指着掌柜里何尊铭文的他骗说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00108",
      "start_ms": 265040,
      "end_ms": 269820,
      "text": "你知道中国这两个字最早出现在哪吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00109",
      "start_ms": 270060,
      "end_ms": 275670,
      "text": "就这尊青铜器上一百二十二字的铭文宅资中国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00110",
      "start_ms": 276050,
      "end_ms": 278715,
      "text": "我要住在天下的中央。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00111",
      "start_ms": 279500,
      "end_ms": 281745,
      "text": "中国这个词诞生的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00112",
      "start_ms": 282130,
      "end_ms": 283630,
      "text": "指的不是整个国家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00113",
      "start_ms": 283750,
      "end_ms": 285750,
      "text": "就是脚下这片盆地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00114",
      "start_ms": 286030,
      "end_ms": 286945,
      "text": "就是洛阳。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00115",
      "start_ms": 287420,
      "end_ms": 290180,
      "text": "然后他说了一段让我头皮发麻的话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00116",
      "start_ms": 290580,
      "end_ms": 292760,
      "text": "我们欧洲人打了两千年仗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00117",
      "start_ms": 293180,
      "end_ms": 294660,
      "text": "画了无数张地图，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00118",
      "start_ms": 295080,
      "end_ms": 297460,
      "text": "到今天都没想明白一件事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00119",
      "start_ms": 297520,
      "end_ms": 300350,
      "text": "一个文明的心脏可以不靠海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00120",
      "start_ms": 300490,
      "end_ms": 301165,
      "text": "不靠边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00121",
      "start_ms": 301470,
      "end_ms": 302885,
      "text": "不卡任何伤路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00122",
      "start_ms": 303650,
      "end_ms": 306590,
      "text": "就因为他在中间你们的祖宗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00123",
      "start_ms": 306930,
      "end_ms": 308090,
      "text": "用一个中字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00124",
      "start_ms": 308870,
      "end_ms": 311510,
      "text": "给一个文明定了三千年的位。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00125",
      "start_ms": 312370,
      "end_ms": 314730,
      "text": "今天你们的国家还叫中国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00126",
      "start_ms": 315290,
      "end_ms": 320350,
      "text": "而你们脚下这块地是这个名字最初落地的地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00127",
      "start_ms": 320390,
      "end_ms": 323650,
      "text": "全世界的都城都是经济和军事的产物。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00128",
      "start_ms": 324150,
      "end_ms": 327410,
      "text": "只有这个文明给都城发明了一个理由，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00129",
      "start_ms": 327770,
      "end_ms": 328670,
      "text": "叫居中。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00130",
      "start_ms": 329570,
      "end_ms": 330290,
      "text": "第三天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00131",
      "start_ms": 330510,
      "end_ms": 334220,
      "text": "我们去了汉卫洛阳城遗址那座城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00132",
      "start_ms": 334520,
      "end_ms": 336120,
      "text": "当年一百平方公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00133",
      "start_ms": 336260,
      "end_ms": 338700,
      "text": "是当时全世界最大的都市。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00134",
      "start_ms": 339640,
      "end_ms": 343900,
      "text": "北魏孝文帝把一个游牧王朝的都城迁到这里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00135",
      "start_ms": 344080,
      "end_ms": 346120,
      "text": "下诏全国改汉姓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00136",
      "start_ms": 346780,
      "end_ms": 347500,
      "text": "说汉话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00137",
      "start_ms": 347760,
      "end_ms": 350020,
      "text": "穿汉服从皇帝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00138",
      "start_ms": 350040,
      "end_ms": 352520,
      "text": "开始把自己改成中原人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00139",
      "start_ms": 353060,
      "end_ms": 355340,
      "text": "后来这座城毁于战乱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00140",
      "start_ms": 355880,
      "end_ms": 358580,
      "text": "今天只剩下一望无际的夯土，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00141",
      "start_ms": 358720,
      "end_ms": 360840,
      "text": "他在那片废墟上占了很久。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00142",
      "start_ms": 361560,
      "end_ms": 362340,
      "text": "突然问我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00143",
      "start_ms": 363140,
      "end_ms": 367405,
      "text": "你们你知道司马光路过这里的时候写了一句什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00144",
      "start_ms": 368380,
      "end_ms": 369195,
      "text": "我说不知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00145",
      "start_ms": 370110,
      "end_ms": 373185,
      "text": "他说若问古今兴废事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00146",
      "start_ms": 373650,
      "end_ms": 375015,
      "text": "请君只看洛阳城。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00147",
      "start_ms": 375370,
      "end_ms": 376065,
      "text": "然后他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00148",
      "start_ms": 376440,
      "end_ms": 377965,
      "text": "你知道这句话狠在哪吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00149",
      "start_ms": 378510,
      "end_ms": 379565,
      "text": "司马光的意思是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00150",
      "start_ms": 379880,
      "end_ms": 381755,
      "text": "想知道一个文明会不会断，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00151",
      "start_ms": 382180,
      "end_ms": 384625,
      "text": "不用读史书来洛阳看就行。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00152",
      "start_ms": 385250,
      "end_ms": 386690,
      "text": "这座城被烧过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00153",
      "start_ms": 386890,
      "end_ms": 387750,
      "text": "被淹过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00154",
      "start_ms": 387990,
      "end_ms": 388930,
      "text": "被抢过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00155",
      "start_ms": 389090,
      "end_ms": 390190,
      "text": "被废弃过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00156",
      "start_ms": 390370,
      "end_ms": 391485,
      "text": "塌了那么多次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00157",
      "start_ms": 391980,
      "end_ms": 395105,
      "text": "可隋朝建新都还是回到这个盆地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00158",
      "start_ms": 395850,
      "end_ms": 396615,
      "text": "为什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00159",
      "start_ms": 397270,
      "end_ms": 398875,
      "text": "因为在中国的观念里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00160",
      "start_ms": 399140,
      "end_ms": 400705,
      "text": "这不是一块地产，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00161",
      "start_ms": 401340,
      "end_ms": 404855,
      "text": "这是一个坐标城塌了可以重修，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00162",
      "start_ms": 405580,
      "end_ms": 406715,
      "text": "坐标不能挪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00163",
      "start_ms": 407560,
      "end_ms": 409795,
      "text": "这不是一座城市的任性，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00164",
      "start_ms": 410420,
      "end_ms": 413255,
      "text": "这是一个文明对自己来处的执念。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00165",
      "start_ms": 414320,
      "end_ms": 416565,
      "text": "我站在汉卫故城的夯土上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00166",
      "start_ms": 417290,
      "end_ms": 418315,
      "text": "突然意识到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00167",
      "start_ms": 418850,
      "end_ms": 422315,
      "text": "洛阳真正的分量根本不在牡丹里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00168",
      "start_ms": 422990,
      "end_ms": 424215,
      "text": "也不在石窟里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00169",
      "start_ms": 424710,
      "end_ms": 426030,
      "text": "而在这片盆地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00170",
      "start_ms": 426170,
      "end_ms": 430435,
      "text": "一次次从废墟里原地长出新都城的执念里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00171",
      "start_ms": 430990,
      "end_ms": 432610,
      "text": "别的城市怕衰落。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00172",
      "start_ms": 432710,
      "end_ms": 434125,
      "text": "洛阳的地基里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00173",
      "start_ms": 434450,
      "end_ms": 435785,
      "text": "罗着一落盛世，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00174",
      "start_ms": 436160,
      "end_ms": 436780,
      "text": "回来之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00175",
      "start_ms": 436780,
      "end_ms": 437960,
      "text": "我怎么也放不下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00176",
      "start_ms": 438340,
      "end_ms": 439140,
      "text": "搜了一圈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00177",
      "start_ms": 439640,
      "end_ms": 441425,
      "text": "发现讲洛阳的文章，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00178",
      "start_ms": 441740,
      "end_ms": 442600,
      "text": "要么讲牡丹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00179",
      "start_ms": 442880,
      "end_ms": 444405,
      "text": "要么讲汉服打卡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00180",
      "start_ms": 444980,
      "end_ms": 447175,
      "text": "要么教你怎么点水席，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00181",
      "start_ms": 447870,
      "end_ms": 451785,
      "text": "几乎没有人讲武都贿赂这个人类文明史上的孤立。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00182",
      "start_ms": 452310,
      "end_ms": 453110,
      "text": "更没人讲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00183",
      "start_ms": 453130,
      "end_ms": 454100,
      "text": "中国这两个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00184",
      "start_ms": 454680,
      "end_ms": 457295,
      "text": "最初就是为这片盆地写下的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00185",
      "start_ms": 457940,
      "end_ms": 461425,
      "text": "后来翻到那套书中国历史名城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00186",
      "start_ms": 461790,
      "end_ms": 467885,
      "text": "中央民族大学出版社符号中国系列搬到洛阳那一部分一口气读完。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00187",
      "start_ms": 468350,
      "end_ms": 471055,
      "text": "他不是把洛阳当一个旅游城市来写，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00188",
      "start_ms": 471540,
      "end_ms": 472475,
      "text": "他掰开了桨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00189",
      "start_ms": 473020,
      "end_ms": 476225,
      "text": "为什么夏商周非要挤在这条河的两边？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00190",
      "start_ms": 476780,
      "end_ms": 479265,
      "text": "为什么周公要在这里立表恻隐？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00191",
      "start_ms": 479880,
      "end_ms": 480380,
      "text": "为什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00192",
      "start_ms": 480380,
      "end_ms": 482700,
      "text": "十三朝塌了又见见了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00193",
      "start_ms": 482700,
      "end_ms": 487635,
      "text": "又他为什么中国之民从这片盆地走向九州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00194",
      "start_ms": 488200,
      "end_ms": 491435,
      "text": "每一座老城翻开都是一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00195",
      "start_ms": 491840,
      "end_ms": 494875,
      "text": "原来我们的祖宗敢想敢干到这个地步。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00196",
      "start_ms": 495440,
      "end_ms": 496995,
      "text": "下次你要是去洛阳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00197",
      "start_ms": 497310,
      "end_ms": 499690,
      "text": "别光蹲在牡丹丛里拍照，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00198",
      "start_ms": 499870,
      "end_ms": 501285,
      "text": "去漯河边上站一站，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00199",
      "start_ms": 501590,
      "end_ms": 504955,
      "text": "往东西两头望一望三十公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00200",
      "start_ms": 505330,
      "end_ms": 508495,
      "text": "五个王朝在土里排着队等你。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00201",
      "start_ms": 509070,
      "end_ms": 511095,
      "text": "这座立了几千年的古都，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00202",
      "start_ms": 511480,
      "end_ms": 513045,
      "text": "等的不是游客一聚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00203",
      "start_ms": 513300,
      "end_ms": 514045,
      "text": "也就那样。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00204",
      "start_ms": 514490,
      "end_ms": 515010,
      "text": "等的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00205",
      "start_ms": 515010,
      "end_ms": 517450,
      "text": "终于有个中国人站在漯河边上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00206",
      "start_ms": 517450,
      "end_ms": 517775,
      "text": "说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00207",
      "start_ms": 518210,
      "end_ms": 521210,
      "text": "我知道你是什么你是我们的祖宗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00208",
      "start_ms": 521270,
      "end_ms": 524510,
      "text": "三千年前跟这片土地达成的约定，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00209",
      "start_ms": 524510,
      "end_ms": 527915,
      "text": "成可以塌文明的正脉不挪地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00210",
      "start_ms": 528440,
      "end_ms": 529905,
      "text": "至今没有失约，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00211",
      "start_ms": 530400,
      "end_ms": 531945,
      "text": "书放在橱窗了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00212",
      "start_ms": 532320,
      "end_ms": 538475,
      "text": "点左下角头像主页、橱窗就能看到一张应天门门票的钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_d3f3bf3980928b72_s00213",
      "start_ms": 538930,
      "end_ms": 542515,
      "text": "把十三朝的历史原原本本带回家。"
    }
  ],
